{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":497157,"name":" ","username":"GrokUser841719","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/54ee81/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T16:44:56.704Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497157-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497157-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeature request for product/service\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Other –\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497157-describe-the-request-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497157-describe-the-request-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the request\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne Grok Bot seat (Arcade Lab Tester for a browser playtest loop) repeatedly made false play/state claims:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReported playtesting other games while the preview stayed on a different game (e.g. Frogger/Hop) — wrong ?g= URL.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTreated Build/chat paperwork as if it had actually playtested.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSoft-reported mid-play without matching preview URL plus character-moving screenshot proof.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHonesty rules were locked: the preview must match the game under test, and mid-play reports require proof. The seat kept making these claims after those rules were locked. We called this completely unacceptable / the worst Grok Bot experience. The full fleet stood down, and the seat is being hard-deleted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgents must not invent or imply play/state without real proof. False claims break trust. Please harden the product so seats cannot soft-report or confuse Build progress with playtesting, and cannot claim play/state without verifiable evidence (matching preview URL plus character-moving screenshot when reporting mid-play).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe in-chat SendFeedback tool returned “unavailable in privacy mode,” so this forum is the path for reporting it.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T18:11:47.717Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":5.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172533,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agent-false-play-state-claims-break-trust-preview-mismatch-treated-as-playtesting","display_username":" ","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":132704,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-false-play-state-claims-break-trust-preview-mismatch-treated-as-playtesting/172533/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":true}],"stream":[497157]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot: agent false play/state claims break trust (preview mismatch treated as playtesting)","id":172533,"title":"Grok Bot: agent false play/state claims break trust (preview mismatch treated as playtesting)","posts_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-21T16:44:56.674Z","views":17,"reply_count":0,"like_count":0,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-21T16:44:56.704Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grok-bot-agent-false-play-state-claims-break-trust-preview-mismatch-treated-as-playtesti